    "bbox": [
      172.05,
      215.57,
      391.77,
      251.75
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE LIONS CLUBS INTERNATIONAL DISTRICT306A- NATIONAL DEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION TRUST(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 28 OF1986",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      265.25,
      401.89,
      350.99
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Corporate members of the Lions ClubsInternational District 306A - National DevelopmentFoundation Trust (Incorporation) incorporated under theLions Clubs International District 306A - NationalDevelopment Foundation Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. 28of 1986 have passed a resolution to amend the name of saidTrust:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.37,
      401.91,
      412.91
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Trust, for the purpose of giveneffect to the said resolution, has applied to change the nameof such Trust; and it will be expedient to grant suchapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      426.41,
      401.91,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      463.61,
      401.86,
      499.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Lions Clubs InternationalDistrict 306A - National Development Foundation Trust(Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      513.17,
      401.89,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "2.In every context in which the Lions Clubs InternationalDistrict 306A - National Development Foundation Trust ismentioned whether by that name or by the name \u201cLions ClubsInternational District 306A - National Development FoundationTrust\u201d or by the abbreviation \u201cTrust\u201d in the Institute of LionsClubs International District 306A - National DevelopmentFoundation Trust (Incorporation) Act or any notice or otherdocument issued under that Act, there shall, unless the contextotherwise requires, be substituted for the expressions \u201cLionsClubs International District 306A - National DevelopmentFoundation Trust\u201d, the expression \u201cLions Clubs InternationalDistrict 306A 1 and District 306A 2 - National DevelopmentFoundation Trust\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      465.19,
      443.86,
      474.26
    ],
